        {
          "text": "Lino basilutwe boonse babasilumamba, a-Johanani mwana wa-Kareya a-Jezaniya mwana wa-Hosaya, abantu boonse buyo nibaba baniini nibaba bapati, bakaswena kuli-Jeremiya musinsimi, ",
