                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumakani oonse, naaba mabotu naaba mabi, tunooswiilila ijwi lya-Jehova Leza wesu ngutwakutuma kulinguwe, kuti tukajane coolwe mukuswiilila ijwi lya-Jehova Leza wesu.",
          "type": "text",
