        },
        {
          "text": "Mutayoowi mwami wa-Babuloni ngumuyoowede. Mutamuyoowi, mbwaamba Jehova, nkaambo ndili anywebo kukumuvuna kuzwa kumaanza aakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
