        },
        {
          "text": "Pele na mwaamba kuti, Tatuyandi kukala munyika ino, aboobo mwakaka kuswiilila ijwi lya-Jehova Leza wanu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.13",
