        {
          "text": "lino amuswiilile ijwi lya-Jehova nuba-Juda basyeede, Mbuboobu mbwaamba Jehova wamakamu Leza wa-Israyeli. Na mwayumya myoyo yanu akukakatila kumuyeeyo wakuya ku-Egepita kuyookala nkuko, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
