        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaambo mbuboobu mbwaamba Jehova wamakamu Leza wa-Israyeli, Mbubonya mbuli bukali bwangu buyoosya mbubwakatililwa bantu ibakakede mu-Jerusalemu, bukali bwangu buyootilwa mbubonya kulibaabo basi inke ku-Egepita. Muyooba lukwanzo aciyoosyo, muyootukilwa akusampaulwa, nkabela busena obuno tamukooyoobubona limbi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
